{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"mission":1,"hero":457},{"id":2,"agency":3,"agency_full":4,"sector":5,"dest":6,"color":7,"year":8,"status":9,"departure_date":10,"arrival_date":11,"transit_days":12,"vehicle":13,"payload":14,"delta_v":15,"data_quality":16,"credit":17,"links":18,"flight_data_quality":33,"fleet_refs":34,"flight":44,"name":437,"type":438,"first":439,"description":440,"events":441,"vehicle_stage":46},"tianwen1","CNSA","China National Space Administration / China Aerospace Science and Technology Corp.","gov","MARS","#DE2910",2020,"ACTIVE","2020-07-23","2021-02-10",202,"Long March 5","5000 kg (orbiter + lander + Zhurong rover)","~5 km/s","good","© CNSA. First mission to succeed in delivering an orbiter, lander, and rover to Mars in a single launch (the Soviet Mars 3 attempted it in 1971). Lander/rover touchdown 2021-05-14 at Utopia Planitia. Zhurong rover went into hibernation 2022-05; orbiter remains active.",[19,23,26,30],{"l":20,"u":21,"t":22},"Tianwen-1 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tianwen-1","intro",{"l":24,"u":25,"t":22},"国家航天局 (CNSA, English)","https://www.cnsa.gov.cn/english/",{"l":27,"u":28,"t":29},"天问一号 — 中文维基百科","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E9%97%AE%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7","core",{"l":31,"u":32,"t":22},"Zhurong rover — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhurong_(rover)","measured",[35,38,41],{"id":36,"role":37},"long-march-5","launcher",{"id":39,"role":40},"zhurong","spacecraft",{"id":42,"role":43},"wenchang-lc-101","launch-site",{"launch":45,"cruise":50,"arrival":53,"totals":63,"events":67,"interplanetary_profile":103},{"vehicle_stage":46,"c3_km2_s2":47,"mass_at_tli_kg":48,"source":49},"Long March 5 YZ-1 upper stage",14.5,5000,"CNSA Tianwen-1 Project Report (2021); CAST mission overview",{"tcm_count":51,"source":52},4,"CNSA Tianwen-1 Mission Operations Report",{"v_infinity_km_s":54,"periapsis_km":55,"inclination_deg":56,"orbit_insertion_dv_km_s":57,"source":58,"entry_velocity_km_s":59,"edl_system":60,"edl_duration_s":61,"touchdown_velocity_ms":62},2.7,265,87,1.1,"CNSA Tianwen-1 MOI Report (2021-02)",4.8,"parachute_retro",538,2.4,{"total_dv_km_s":64,"tli_or_tmi_dv_km_s":65,"source":66},5,3.5,"CNSA Tianwen-1 Project Report (2021)",[68,73,78,83,87,90,94,98],{"met_days":69,"type":70,"label":71,"description":72},0,"launch","Launch — Long March 5","Wenchang, China, 2020-07-23. CNSA's first interplanetary mission, named after the poem Tianwen ('Questions to Heaven') by Qu Yuan (c. 340–278 BCE). Tianwen-1 was the first Mars mission to carry an orbiter + lander + rover (Zhurong) in a single launch and succeed — orbit, land, AND drive on the first attempt (the Soviet Mars 3 attempted the same in 1971).",{"met_days":74,"type":75,"label":76,"description":77},0.005,"tli_or_tmi","Trans-Mars injection","Long March 5 YZ-1 upper stage burn places Tianwen-1 on a 7-month Mars-transfer trajectory.",{"met_days":79,"type":80,"label":81,"description":82},30,"tcm","TCM-1","First post-TMI cleanup burn.",{"met_days":84,"type":80,"label":85,"description":86},46.46,"TCM-2","Mid-cruise refinement.",{"met_days":88,"type":80,"label":89,"description":86},100,"TCM-3",{"met_days":91,"type":80,"label":92,"description":93},200,"TCM-4 — final pre-MOI burn","Final approach targeting for Mars orbit insertion.",{"met_days":12,"type":95,"label":96,"description":97},"arrival","Mars orbit insertion","2021-02-10. 15-minute main engine burn captured Tianwen-1 into a highly-elliptical Mars orbit. The orbiter spent 3 months scouting the planned EDL site at Utopia Planitia before releasing the lander.",{"met_days":99,"type":100,"label":101,"description":102},295,"edl_or_oi","Zhurong Mars rover EDL — Utopia Planitia","2021-05-14. Lander + rover deployed via parachute + retrorockets to the surface. Zhurong became the first Chinese rover on Mars — China the second nation to successfully drive on Mars after the United States. Zhurong operated until May 2022 when winter dust prevented solar charging; the orbiter continues.",{"source_tier":104,"reference_frame":105,"departure_body":106,"arrival_body":107,"transfer_type":108,"tcm_count":51,"waypoints_helio_au":109},"tier_1_5_hybrid","heliocentric_ecliptic_J2000","earth","mars","type1_lambert",[110,113,117,121,125,129,133,137,141,145,149,152,156,160,164,168,171,175,179,183,187,191,195,199,203,207,211,215,219,223,227,231,235,238,242,246,250,254,258,262,266,270,274,278,282,286,290,294,298,302,306,310,314,318,322,326,330,334,338,342,346,350,354,358,362,365,368,372,374,376,378,380,382,384,386,388,390,392,394,396,398,400,402,404,406,408,410,412,414,416,418,420,422,424,426,427,429,431,433,435],[69,111,69,112],0.516078,-0.856541,[114,115,69,116],3.1288,0.568471,-0.829658,[118,119,69,120],6.2576,0.619257,-0.800416,[122,123,69,124],9.3864,0.668312,-0.768939,[126,127,69,128],12.5152,0.715538,-0.735356,[130,131,69,132],15.6439,0.760846,-0.699801,[134,135,69,136],18.7727,0.804159,-0.662413,[138,139,69,140],21.9015,0.845414,-0.623328,[142,143,69,144],25.0303,0.884556,-0.582686,[146,147,69,148],28.1591,0.921543,-0.540624,[79,150,69,151],0.942322,-0.515287,[153,154,69,155],34.4167,0.988932,-0.452782,[157,158,69,159],37.5455,1.019296,-0.407267,[161,162,69,163],40.6742,1.047427,-0.36086,[165,166,69,167],43.803,1.073329,-0.313684,[84,169,69,170],1.093563,-0.273104,[172,173,69,174],50.0606,1.118478,-0.217497,[176,177,69,178],53.1894,1.137759,-0.168709,[180,181,69,182],56.3182,1.154874,-0.1196,[184,185,69,186],59.447,1.169853,-0.070269,[188,189,69,190],62.5758,1.182728,-0.020811,[192,193,69,194],65.7045,1.193533,0.028684,[196,197,69,198],68.8333,1.202307,0.07813,[200,201,69,202],71.9621,1.20909,0.127447,[204,205,69,206],75.0909,1.213925,0.17656,[208,209,69,210],78.2197,1.216855,0.225396,[212,213,69,214],81.3485,1.217926,0.273887,[216,217,69,218],84.4773,1.217184,0.321972,[220,221,69,222],87.6061,1.214675,0.369589,[224,225,69,226],90.7348,1.210447,0.416684,[228,229,69,230],93.8636,1.204549,0.463204,[232,233,69,234],96.9924,1.197027,0.5091,[88,